        "Content": "COMING SOON... \r\n\r\nENQUIRE TODAY FOR PRIVATE ACCESS TO A PRE-MARKET VIEWING.\r\n3 BEDROOM / 2 BATHROOM\r\n\r\nDixon Residential Estate Agents - The Dublin Property Experts are delighted to present 11 Cardy Rock Road to the Balbriggan property market.\r\n\r\nOffering a wonderful blend of coastal living and urban convenience, this property provides an excellent opportunity for buyers seeking comfort, space, and potential.\r\n\r\nSet in a thriving and well-connected community, residents can enjoy easy access to Balbriggan Train Station, the nearby M1, and an array of local amenities including schools, cafés, shops, and restaurants. The coastline is just minutes away, offering beautiful seaside walks, parks, and outdoor activities right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThis property will appeal to first-time buyers, families, downsizers, and investors seeking a well-located home with fantastic potential in a growing coastal town.\r\n\r\n***\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
